<title>USA: Sioux City hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 lower. Trade moderately active. Top $59.00 per cwt. -</p>
<p>USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     59.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     58.00-58.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     56.00-57.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     52.50-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: 300-400 lbs steady to 0.50 higher; 400-700 lbs steady to 1.25 lower. Top $49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs     45.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs     46.50</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     48.50</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs     49.50</p>
</text>
